cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use DeepSpaceTelemetry.jl in your work, cite it as below."
title: "DeepSpaceTelemetry.jl: a telemetry, channel, and queuing simulator for deep-space science missions"
abstract: >-
  A Julia framework that simulates the telemetry environment of a deep-space
  science mission end to end: duty-cycled ground-station contact windows with
  seasonal and scheduled variation, a physical downlink carrying stochastic
  packet loss and scheduled disruptions, prioritized near-real-time (FIFO)
  transmission with LIFO archival backfill, and the resulting alert-latency
  and delivery-delay metrology. The telemetry, channel, and queuing layers
  are mission-agnostic; the shipped scenarios and the amplitude-calibrated
  synthetic payload model LISA. External analysis pipelines couple to a run
  through a documented read-only filesystem contract.
type: software
